UPDATE companies SET description='Parkman Woodworks was founded in 2015 on Parkman Avenue in Silverlake, Los Angeles, California, starting with a pickup truck and a thousand dollars. The founders built their first pieces from sustainable wood in a friend''s driveway. Graham Taglang has served as the public face of the company since its inception.

The company produces custom handmade wood and steel furniture, including conference tables, dining tables, bed frames, desks, coffee tables, bookshelves, consoles, and benches. All pieces are made to order, from raw material selection through final delivery.

Parkman serves residential clients and commercial accounts across corporate offices, restaurants, and hospitality spaces. Notable product categories include live-edge dining tables, custom conference tables for boardrooms, and banquette seating for kitchen and dining areas.

The company''s stated mission is to turn wasted wood into practical art while advancing the values of handcraft. They emphasize hyperlocal sourcing, using solid lumber recovered from naturally fallen Southern California trees and structures. Accountability, awareness, and achievement are cited as core values, with every team member involved from inception to inspection of each piece.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom wood furniture manufacturing", "Steel/iron fabrication", "Powder coating (low-carbon iron)", "Wood charring", "In-house design and engineering", "Live edge furniture", "Custom conference tables", "Custom dining tables", "Custom bed frames", "Custom desks", "Custom shelving and casegoods", "Restaurant furniture production"], "industries": ["Corporate Office", "Dining Room", "Bedroom", "Kitchen & Banquette", "Home Office", "Living Room", "Restaurant Furniture", "Trade"], "materials": ["Solid hardwoods", "Naturally fallen lumber (Southern California)", "Low-carbon iron", "Powder coating", "Antique timber"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": [], "facts_used": ["Founded 2015 on Parkman Avenue in Silverlake, Los Angeles -> /about-us", "Started with pickup truck and $1000, building in buddy''s driveway -> /about-us", "Graham Taglang public face since 2015 -> /about-us", "Moved to historic brick-and-timber textile mill in 2019 -> /about-us", "Building celebrated 100th birthday in 2023 -> /about-us", "Team of six craftspeople (Graham, Kyle, Jimmy, Susannah, Preston, Randy) -> /about-us", "Mission: turn wasted wood into practical art -> /about-us", "Values: Accountability, Awareness, Achievement -> /about-us", "Hyperlocal sustainably sourced wood from Southern California trees -> /", "In-house design to delivery process -> /about-us", "Address: 160 S Mission Rd, Los Angeles, CA 90033 -> /", "Phone:  -> /", "Custom furniture categories: conference tables, dining tables, bed frames, desks, etc. -> /", "Low-carbon iron finished with powder coating -> / (capabilities)", "Wood charring capability -> /about-us (Kyle Jordan)", "Live edge furniture -> /", "Restaurant furniture -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Custom Handmade Wood & Steel Furniture", "founded_year": "2015", "employee_count": "6", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='parkman-woodworks' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Parts Inc. has operated from Great Bend, Kansas, for more than 50 years.

The company stocks and supplies components across automotive, agricultural, industrial, and oilfield sectors. Its shop specializes in custom hydraulic and air‑conditioning hose fabrication, assembly, and repair, supported by an inventory of thousands of adapters and fittings for foreign and domestic applications. Additional offerings include automotive paints, truck equipment and parts (air brakes, lighting, exhaust, DOT items), starters, alternators, generators, batteries, mufflers and exhaust systems up to six inches, and a range of car, truck, and jeep accessories. Parts Inc. also restores and maintains a fleet of historic military vehicles — half‑tracks, jeeps, amphibious tractors, and tanks — known as the Old Warhorses Collection, and operates as a licensed firearms dealer (FFL, NFA, SOT) with optics, suppressors, and military‑surplus items such as ammo cans, jacks, tools, and footwear.

Customers include jobbers, dealers, fleets, and individual owners across central Kansas. Agricultural operators around St. John, Pratt, and Great Bend rely on the shop for high‑cycle hose assemblies during harvest; oilfield trucks near Macksville and Stafford use water‑transfer and suction hoses; commercial truck fleets on the US‑281 and Highway 50 corridors source air‑brake and DOT‑required parts. The military‑vehicle collection serves re‑unions, parades, and veteran‑honoring events, while the firearms counter serves licensed buyers.

The company emphasizes local turnaround — same‑day hydraulic hose assembly is often possible when components are in stock — and a broad fitting inventory that covers JIC, NPT, ORFS, and other standards, allowing operators to avoid shipping delays from distant distributors.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom hydraulic hose fabrication", "Hydraulic hose assembly and repair", "Air conditioning hose assembly", "Hydraulic and AC adapter and fitting supply", "Water transfer and suction hose supply", "Automotive paint supply", "Truck equipment and parts supply (air brakes, lighting, exhaust, DOT items)", "Historic military vehicle restoration and maintenance", "Firearms sales (FFL, NFA, SOT)", "Military surplus sales (ammo cans, jacks, tools, footwear)", "Automotive accessories (car, truck, jeep)", "Starter, alternator and generator supply", "Battery supply", "Muffler and exhaust system supply (up to 6\")"], "industries": ["Automotive", "Agricultural", "Industrial", "Oil and gas", "Military vehicle restoration", "Firearms"], "materials": ["Hydraulic hose", "Air conditioning hose", "Water transfer hose", "Suction hose", "Automotive paint", "Truck equipment parts", "Military vehicle parts", "Firearms", "Optics", "Suppressors", "Batteries", "Starters", "Alternators", "Generators", "Mufflers", "Exhaust systems"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Same-day custom hydraulic hose assembly often possible depending on stock", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Same-day custom hydraulic hose assembly often possible depending on stock", "Thousands of hydraulic and AC adapters and fittings in stock covering JIC, NPT, ORFS and other standards", "Locally fabricated replacements reduce wait times for agricultural and oilfield equipment", "Historic military vehicle fleet (Old Warhorses Collection) available for rides, reunions, parades and veteran events", "Licensed firearms dealer with FFL, NFA, SOT items, optics, suppressors and military surplus"], "facts_used": ["Location: Great Bend, KS -> db", "Over 50 years in business -> /", "Owners: Kevin & Kenton Lockwood -> /", "Industries served: Automotive, Agricultural, Industrial, Oil field -> /", "Customer types: jobbers, dealers, fleets, individuals -> /", "Custom hydraulic hose fabrication, assembly, repair -> /services", "Air conditioning hose assembly -> /services", "Thousands of hydraulic and AC adapters and fittings -> /services", "Water transfer and suction hoses for oil field trucks -> /services", "Automotive paints & supplies -> /services", "Truck equipment & parts (air brake, brake linings, lighting, exhaust, DOT items, load securing) -> /services", "Historic military vehicle restoration (Old Warhorses Collection) -> /services", "Licensed firearms dealer (FFL, NFA, SOT) with optics, suppressors, accessories -> /services", "Military surplus items (ammo cans, jacks, tools, footwear) -> /services", "Car, truck, jeep accessories -> /services", "Starters, alternators, generators for antique to late models -> /services", "Full selection of batteries -> /services", "Mufflers & exhaust systems up to 6\" -> /services", "Same-day hydraulic hose assembly often possible -> /services", "Service area: St. John, KS and south-central Kansas (US-281, Highway 50 corridors) -> /services", "Serves farmers, ranchers, oilfield operators, commercial truck fleets -> /services"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We offer products and services in the following areas: Automotive, Agricultural, Industrial, Oil field. We work with jobbers, dealers, fleets and individuals.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='parts-inc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Parts Score operates from Scottsdale, Arizona, in the Scottsdale Airpark area. The business is family‑run, with the owners directly involved in day‑to‑day operations and customer interactions.

The company provides a full range of services for Audi, BMW, and Volkswagen models. These include scheduled preventative maintenance, general service repairs, performance modifications such as coilover and spring installations, big‑brake upgrades, supercharger kits, and custom fabrication for show‑car builds. They also stock and sell OEM replacement parts as well as aftermarket performance components from brands like KW Suspension, BBS, CTS Turbo, and others. The facility handles projects from routine brake jobs and timing‑belt service to complete engine swaps and air‑suspension installations.

Parts Score serves owners and enthusiasts of European performance cars, primarily Audi, BMW, and Volkswagen. Their customer base includes individuals seeking routine maintenance, those upgrading suspension or braking systems, and clients commissioning full custom builds — such as a Brooklyn Grey G80 with KW suspension and 1000M wheels, or a Rosso Corsa BMW M4 equipped with BBS wheels and a stage‑2 performance package.

The shop emphasizes its family‑owned structure as a differentiator: one of the owners is always available to discuss a project, and they aim to provide personal, prompt service at competitive rates. The founders frame automotive performance as an art form, focusing on clean installations and a collaborative experience for each unique build.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Scheduled preventative maintenance", "General service repairs", "Performance suspension installation (coilovers, springs, air suspension)", "Big brake kit upgrades", "Supercharger and forced\u2011induction installation", "Custom fabrication", "Engine swaps", "Dyno tuning", "OEM parts supply", "Aftermarket performance parts supply"], "industries": ["European automotive performance", "Automotive service and repair", "Automotive aftermarket parts"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Family\u2011run business with owners directly accessible to customers", "In\u2011house custom fabrication for one\u2011off performance builds", "Stocked OEM and aftermarket performance parts for Audi, BMW, Volkswagen", "Personal, friendly service at competitive rates"], "facts_used": ["Location: Scottsdale, AZ (Scottsdale Airpark) -> /", "Founded 2010 -> /about-us", "Founder Jason with 15+ years experience -> /about-us", "Family-run business, owners always available -> /, /about-us", "Services: maintenance, repairs, performance mods, custom fabrication, parts sales -> /, /about-us", "Brands installed: KW Suspension, BBS, CTS Turbo, JB4, AccuAir, etc. -> /", "Example projects: Brooklyn Grey G80, Rosso Corsa BMW M4, etc. -> /", "Differentiators: personal service, competitive rates, passion for European cars as art -> /, /about-us"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Parts Score is a European Automotive Performance Shop specializing in Audi, BMW and Volkswagen performance modification, performance parts and service.", "founded_year": "2010", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='parts-score' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Partsmax Auto Parts and Accessories operates from Miami, Florida, where it has served the South Florida automotive community for over two decades.

The distributor maintains a 250,000-square-foot warehouse stocked with thousands of auto body parts, including refurbished, aftermarket, high-performance, and rebuilt components sourced from established manufacturers. Inventory covers import and domestic vehicles, with heavy-duty truck parts also available. New accessories and parts are added weekly. The company offers wholesale accounts and processes orders for in-warehouse pickup only, having discontinued its former next-business-day delivery service.

Partsmax positions itself on competitive pricing against original equipment manufacturer parts, a broad in-stock selection designed to eliminate search challenges, and a service model that includes online order tracking, a favorable return policy, and dedicated customer support.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Auto parts distribution", "Wholesale supply", "Inventory management", "Online ordering", "Order tracking", "Returns processing", "In-warehouse pickup fulfillment"], "industries": ["Automotive aftermarket", "Collision repair", "Auto body shops", "Heavy duty truck parts", "Fleet maintenance"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Formerly next business day delivery to Miami-Dade, Broward, and Palm Beach counties; currently in-warehouse pickup only", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["250,000 sq ft warehouse inventory", "Thousands of auto body parts in stock", "Wholesale accounts for trade customers", "Competitive pricing vs OEM parts", "New parts added weekly", "Online order tracking and returns handling", "In-warehouse pickup fulfillment"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: Miami, Florida -> db", "Over 20 years serving South Florida -> page /", "250,000 sq ft warehouse -> page /", "Thousands of auto body parts (refurbished, aftermarket, high-performance, rebuilt) -> page /", "Wholesale accounts offered -> page /", "No longer offers delivery, pickup only -> page /", "Formerly next business day delivery to three counties -> db description", "Heavy duty truck parts available -> page / products", "New parts added weekly -> page /", "Online tracking and returns handling -> page /", "Competitive pricing vs OEM -> page /", "Serves Miami-Dade, Broward, Palm Beach counties -> db description"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Choose from refurbished, aftermarket, high-performance, and rebuilt auto parts from trusted manufacturers.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": ""