UPDATE companies SET description='Plastik USA, a family-owned business with over 15 years of experience, operates from its headquarters in Plainview, New York, while maintaining a 400,000-square-foot manufacturing facility in Ningbo, China. The company also runs branch offices and warehouses in New York to support domestic distribution.

