UPDATE companies SET description='Polymer Components was founded in 1997 in Benton, Tennessee. The company began with a mission to help original equipment manufacturers succeed by supplying quality composite plastic and polyurethane parts with close attention to detail and design.

The shop provides custom molding and prototyping services including injection molding, compression molding, cast molding, SLA 3D printing, and rapid mold production. It handles product development, design, reverse engineering, DFM analysis, FEA, material selection, and color matching.

Customers range from large to small OEMs across industries such as aerospace and medical. The company emphasizes its ability to serve diverse sectors with composite plastics and elastomers.

