UPDATE companies SET description='PolymerPak, LLC operates from Exeter, California, where it develops sustainable food packaging solutions for North American markets.

The firm produces PET-based containers for salads, pastas, desserts, and prepared meals, emphasizing secure seals and high clarity. It reports recycling 1 billion PET bottles annually, incorporating 70 percent post-consumer material, and processing 90 million pounds of recycled PET. No facility size or headcount figures are provided.

PolymerPak serves three primary channels: food processors who pack retail-ready products, food-service distributors that resell to restaurants and small grocers, and retail grocery and warehouse chains that stock fresh, frozen, and prepared foods. The company notes that major food brands purchase its packaging for consumer sale.

A closed-loop cycle — recycle, redesign, recycle, repeat — underpins its environmental commitment. The company states it is dedicated to progressively understanding the effects of its products and operations on the planet, and it lists great service, highest standards, a professional team, and creative solutions as core values.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Sustainable food packaging manufacturing", "PET recycling and reprocessing", "Container design with secure seals and high clarity", "Food packaging for processors, distributors, and retailers", "Post-consumer recycled material integration"], "industries": ["Food processing", "Food service distribution", "Retail grocery and warehouse", "Food packaging"], "materials": ["PET (polyethylene terephthalate)", "Post-consumer recycled PET"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["1 billion PET plastic bottles recycled annually", "70% post-consumer recycled content in containers", "90 million pounds of PET recycled per year", "Closed-loop sustainability cycle: recycle, redesign, recycle, repeat", "Sustainable packaging for foodservice, retail, and distribution across North America"], "facts_used": ["Exeter, California headquarters -> db", "Sustainable food packaging for foodservice, retail, distribution markets throughout North America -> /", "Supplies three major markets: Food Processors, Food Service Distribution & Retail -> /", "1 billion PET plastic bottles recycled, 70% post-consumer, 90 million pounds of PET recycled -> /", "Food processors use containers for salads, pastas, desserts, meals -> /", "Distributors resell to restaurants, bakeries, small grocers -> /", "Retail grocery and warehouse stores buy directly or from processors -> /", "Closed-loop sustainability cycle: RECYCLE \u2014 REDESIGN \u2014 RECYCLE \u2014 REPEAT -> /", "Core values: Great Services, Highest Standards, Professional Team, Creative Solutions -> /", "Commitment to progre