UPDATE companies SET description='Precision Woodworking Inc. operates from Lindon, Utah, in the heart of Utah Valley. The company was founded in 2003 by David and Jill Einerson, a husband-and-wife team who started the business in a residential garage, building cabinets for friends and family. What began as a small family venture has since grown into a full-scale cabinet shop equipped with modern machinery and a team of dedicated craftsmen.

