UPDATE companies SET description='Prime Source Foods operates from its headquarters in Londonderry, New Hampshire, with additional distribution facilities in East Windsor, Connecticut, and a cross-dock in Vassalboro, Maine. The independently owned company has more than 60 years of history as a foodservice distributor serving New England and eastern New York. No founding year or founder names are disclosed in public materials.

